## Medicare Android Application - Supabase Credentials
## Copy this file to `local.properties` in the project root:
## cp local.properties.example local.properties
##
## `local.properties` is listed in .gitignore and will NEVER be committed to GitHub.
## Replace the placeholders below with your actual Supabase Project URL and public anon key.

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-public-anon-key
